1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,470
This pump looks perfectly still.

2
00:00:02,470 --> 00:00:03,308
It isn't.

3
00:00:03,308 --> 00:00:06,952
One part of it is vibrating fifty-eight and a half times a second,

4
00:00:06,952 --> 00:00:09,120
by less than a twentieth of a pixel.

5
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,449
Nothing touched it.

6
00:00:10,449 --> 00:00:12,173
A handheld camera found it.

7
00:00:14,173 --> 00:00:15,360
This is HumSight.

8
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:19,347
It turns a slow-motion phone video into a grid of virtual vibration sensors,

9
00:00:19,347 --> 00:00:24,047
