10
00:00:25,247 --> 00:00:27,978
Machines vibrate abnormally before they fail.

11
00:00:27,978 --> 00:00:31,996
Contact sensors catch that, but they are fitted one machine at a time,

12
00:00:31,996 --> 00:00:34,315
