13
00:00:34,315 --> 00:00:35,654
Video should help.

14
00:00:35,654 --> 00:00:40,549
But the classic trick, magnifying all motion in the video, also magnifies camera shake.

15
00:00:40,549 --> 00:00:43,537
Film handheld, and a healthy machine looks broken.

16
00:00:44,737 --> 00:00:49,716
It's for maintenance technicians checking an unmonitored machine with the phone they already carry.

17
00:00:49,716 --> 00:00:52,786
Plant managers deciding which machines need a real sensor.

18
00:00:52,786 --> 00:00:55,625
Field engineers who need visual proof for a customer.

19
00:00:55,625 --> 00:00:58,742
